<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head is-centered reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow is-centered" data-i18n="camp.faq.eyebrow">Good to know</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="camp.faq.title">Camp questions, answered.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq mt-4">
      <div class="faq__item reveal">
        <button class="faq__q"><span data-i18n="camp.q1">What level do I need for the camp?</span><span class="ico"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><p data-i18n="camp.a1">Complete beginners to solid intermediates. We split the group by level for coaching and match everyone to a spot they can actually surf well.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item reveal">
        <button class="faq__q"><span data-i18n="camp.q2">How many people per camp?</span><span class="ico"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><p data-i18n="camp.a2">We keep camps small &mdash; a handful of guests, not a crowd, so coaching stays personal.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item reveal">
        <button class="faq__q"><span data-i18n="camp.q3">Is airport transfer included?</span><span class="ico"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><p data-i18n="camp.a3">Yes, pick-up from Colombo (CMB) on your arrival day is included for camp bookings.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item reveal">
        <button class="faq__q"><span data-i18n="camp.q4">Can I book the camp solo?</span><span class="ico"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><p data-i18n="camp.a4">Yes. Most guests come solo and pair up with roommates from the group, or ask about the solo room upgrade.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item reveal">
        <button class="faq__q"><span data-i18n="camp.q5">What if I want to stay longer?</span><span class="ico"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><p data-i18n="camp.a5">Extra nights before or after the camp are easy to add at our standard room rate &mdash; just ask when you enquire.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

